  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your strength and bravado are an awesome combination.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Awe-Inspiring Smash<sup>ISC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can add your Strength and your Charisma modifier to performance combat checks, and you can spend a swift action to gain a bonus as the base feat on combat maneuver checks after a successful bull rush, drag, overrun, or sunder combat maneuver.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc10\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
